## Interface: 20506
## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Meters
## Author: Devin
## Version: 2.5.0
## Notes: The battle report — a damage meter with per-fight segments, an ability and target breakdown per actor, a multi-actor throughput graph, an SC2-style APM board, a death log, and an Arena Report that records both teams of every match with a replayable timeline and a dispel log (every purge, cleanse and Mass Dispel, cast by cast).
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Ability_DualWield
## SavedVariables: CommanderMetersDB, CommanderMetersLog, CommanderMetersSession, CommanderMetersArenaLog
## RequiredDeps: Commander_Events
## OptionalDeps: Commander_Muster

